      "id": "sparktraits:oppressive",
      "tab": "TRAIT",
      "sourceModId": "sparktraits",
      "nameKey": "trait.sparktraits.oppressive.name",
      "summaryKey": "trait.sparktraits.oppressive.description",
      "pages": [
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "你在场时，所有人掉理智更快。只会出现在杀手身上，每局最多一个。"
            },
            {
              "type": "section",
              "text": "效果",
              "tone": "danger"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "text": "只要你还活着，所有玩家的理智下降速度变为 1.2 倍。杀手是假理智，不会因此崩溃。"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "text": "你被饕餮吞进肚子时暂时失效。"
            },
            {
              "type": "section",
              "text": "建议",
              "tone": "good"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "text": "活得越久效果越明显：好人得花更多时间做任务，没顾上任务的人也更容易精神崩溃。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "ownerRoleIds": [
        "wathe:killer"
      ],
      "requiredModIds": [
        "sparktraits"
      ],
      "color": "#3B3048",
      "order": 1070
    }
  ]
}
